{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"hx8_hzi_iq5_AA","canonical_person_id":"hx8_hzi_iq5_AA","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["hx8_hzi_iq5_AA"],"persons":[{"id":"hx8_hzi_iq5_A","label":"孫宗世（孫處子）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"宗世","mention_ids":["c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0235","c-songshu-049-sunzongshi:p001:m0001"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0235","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession","quote":"宗世"},{"mention_id":"c-songshu-049-sunzongshi:p001:m0001","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-sunzongshi:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-sunzongshi","quote":"宗世"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"孫宗世（孫處子），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"hx8_hzi_iq5","source_assertion_id":"a-song049-sun-zongshi-chu","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-049","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession","source_id":"s-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession-ws2118585","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001","quote":"義熙七年四月，季高卒於晉康，時年五十三。追贈龍驤將軍、南海太守，封候官縣侯，食邑千戶。九年，高祖念季高之功，乃表曰：「孫季高嶺南之勳，已蒙褒贈。臣更思惟盧循稔惡一紀，據有全域。若令根本未拔，投奔有所，招合餘燼，猶能為虞，縣師遠討，方勤廟算。而季高汎海萬里，投命洪流，波激電邁，指日遄至，遂奄定南海，覆其巢窟，使循進退靡依，輕舟遠迸。曾不旬月，妖凶殲殄。蕩滌之功，實庸為大。往年所贈，猶為未優。愚謂宜更贈一州，即其本號，庶令忠勳不湮，勞臣增厲。」重贈交州刺史，將軍如故。子宗世卒，子欽公嗣。欽公卒，子彥祖嗣。齊受禪，國除。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0235","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0007","source_term":"子宗世"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"承同段傳主季高贈官而出其子。"}},{"id":"hx8_hzi_iq5_AA","label":"孫欽公（孫宗世子）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"欽公","mention_ids":["c-songshu-049-sun-jigao-succession:p001:m0240","c-songshu-049-su